10 REM MAZE WALK: A PERFECT MAZE, DUG BY A RECURSIVE BACKTRACKER
20 REM EVERY CELL IS REACHED EXACTLY ONCE, SO THE GOAL IS ALWAYS REACHABLE
30 REM AND EVERY PASSAGE IS ONE CHARACTER WIDE
40 REM THE TEXT SCREEN IS BOTH THE MAP AND THE MEMORY: SCR$ READS BACK
50 REM WHAT WAS PRINTED, SO ONLY THE BACKTRACK STACK NEEDS AN ARRAY
60 REM KEYBOARD ONLY: THE ARROW KEYS ARE READ THROUGH STICK(0), AND THE
70 REM NAME ENTRY AT THE GOAL IS INKEY$, WHICH IS ALSO THE KANA INPUT DEMO
80 REM SHOWS LOCATE, COLOR, SCR$, RND, DIM, DATA/READ, PAUSE, KANA, BEEP
90 CLS
100 REM 13 X 10 CELLS BECOME A 27 X 21 CHARACTER MAZE AT (0,3)
110 W=13:H=10:OX=0:OY=3
120 DIM SK(130),CD(3),VX(3),VY(3)
130 FOR I=0 TO 3:READ VX(I):NEXT
140 DATA 1,-1,0,0
150 FOR I=0 TO 3:READ VY(I):NEXT
160 DATA 0,0,1,-1
161 REM TITLE. RND IS SEEDED THE SAME ON EVERY RUN, SO THE MAZE WOULD
162 REM ALWAYS COME OUT IDENTICAL. BURNING RND WHILE WAITING FOR THE
163 REM START KEY MAKES THE PLAYER'S OWN TIMING THE SEED
164 LOCATE 11,8:PRINT "メイロ"
165 LOCATE 6,12:PRINT "ヤジルシデ G マデ"
166 LOCATE 9,16:PRINT "Z ヲ オセ"
167 Q=RND(100):PAUSE 1
168 IF (STRIG(0) AND 8)=0 THEN 167
169 A$=INKEY$:IF A$<>"" THEN 169
170 CLS:LOCATE 1,0:PRINT "ヤジルシデ G マデ アルケ"
180 LOCATE 1,1:PRINT "メイロ ヲ ホッテイマス"
190 REM SOLID ROCK FIRST: ONE PRINT PER ROW, 27 CHARACTERS EACH
200 R$=""
210 FOR I=1 TO 27:R$=R$+"#":NEXT
220 FOR Y=0 TO 2*H
230 LOCATE OX,OY+Y:PRINT R$;
240 NEXT
245 REM DIGGING IS THOUSANDS OF STATEMENTS. THE DEFAULT PACE (60 PER
246 REM FRAME, WHICH IS WHAT KEEPS THE GAME AT THE ORIGINAL SPEED)
247 REM WOULD MAKE IT CRAWL, SO RAISE IT WHILE DIGGING AND PUT IT BACK
248 _SPEED 600
250 GOSUB 1000
255 _SPEED 60
260 LOCATE 1,1:PRINT "                      ";
270 REM THE GOAL SITS IN THE LAST CELL, THE PLAYER IN THE FIRST
280 GX=OX+1+(W-1)*2:GY=OY+1+(H-1)*2
290 COLOR GX,GY,2
300 LOCATE GX,GY:PRINT "G";
310 PX=OX+1:PY=OY+1:ST=0
320 LOCATE PX,PY:PRINT "P";
400 REM MAIN LOOP. STICK(0) REPORTS A KEY THAT IS STILL HELD DOWN, SO
401 REM READING IT EVERY FEW FRAMES WALKS SEVERAL CELLS PER TAP. THIS
402 REM REPEATS LIKE A KEYBOARD INSTEAD: A NEWLY SEEN DIRECTION MOVES AT
403 REM ONCE, AND HOLDING WAITS RD FRAMES FOR THE FIRST REPEAT AND RI
404 REM FRAMES FOR THE ONES AFTER IT. A TAP IS THEREFORE EXACTLY ONE CELL
405 RD=20:RI=7:LS=0:RP=0:F=0
410 PAUSE 1
412 S=STICK(0)
414 IF S=0 THEN LS=0:GOTO 410
416 IF S<>LS THEN LS=S:RP=RD:F=1:GOTO 420
417 RP=RP-1
418 IF RP>0 THEN 410
419 RP=RI:F=0
420 DX=0:DY=0
430 IF (S AND 1)<>0 THEN DX=1
440 IF (S AND 2)<>0 THEN DX=-1
450 IF (S AND 4)<>0 THEN DY=1
460 IF (S AND 8)<>0 THEN DY=-1
470 REM NO DIAGONALS: A ONE WIDE PASSAGE HAS NO ROOM TO CUT A CORNER
480 IF DX<>0 THEN DY=0
490 IF DX=0 AND DY=0 THEN 410
500 NX=PX+DX:NY=PY+DY
510 B$=SCR$(NX,NY)
520 IF B$="#" THEN 590
530 LOCATE PX,PY:PRINT " ";
540 PX=NX:PY=NY:LOCATE PX,PY:PRINT "P";
550 ST=ST+1
560 IF B$="G" THEN 600
570 GOTO 410
590 REM WALL. ONLY THE FIRST PRESS BEEPS, NOT EVERY REPEAT
595 IF F=1 THEN BEEP
598 GOTO 410
600 REM GOAL. THE NAME IS TYPED ONE INKEY$ AT A TIME, SO THE KANA MODE
610 REM (TAB, THEN TWO ROMAJI KEYS PER KANA) CAN BE TRIED HERE
620 CLS
630 LOCATE 10,4:PRINT "クリア!"
640 LOCATE 9,6:PRINT "STEPS";ST
650 LOCATE 2,10:PRINT "ナマエ ヲ イレテ"
660 LOCATE 2,12:PRINT "TAB カナ  ENTER オワリ"
670 N$=""
680 LOCATE 2,15:PRINT N$;"_ ";
690 PAUSE 1
700 A$=INKEY$
710 IF A$="" THEN 690
715 REM ENTER ARRIVES AS LF (FMRB_KEYMAP.C MAPS IT TO 10), NOT CR
720 IF A$=CHR$(10) OR A$=CHR$(13) THEN 760
730 IF A$<" " THEN 690
740 IF LEN(N$)<12 THEN N$=N$+A$
750 GOTO 680
760 LOCATE 2,15:PRINT N$;"  ";
770 IF LEN(N$)=0 THEN 790
780 LOCATE 2,18:PRINT N$;" サン オメデトウ"
790 PAUSE 300
800 END
1000 REM RECURSIVE BACKTRACKER, THE STACK HELD IN SK() AS CELL NUMBERS.
1010 REM A CELL COUNTS AS VISITED ONCE ITS CHARACTER IS A SPACE, WHICH
1020 REM IS WHAT SCR$ REPORTS, SO NO SEPARATE VISITED MAP IS NEEDED
1030 LOCATE OX+1,OY+1:PRINT " ";
1040 SK(0)=0:SP=1
1050 IF SP=0 THEN RETURN
1060 T=SK(SP-1):CX=T MOD W:CY=T/W
1070 N=0
1080 FOR D=0 TO 3
1090 NX=CX+VX(D):NY=CY+VY(D)
1100 IF NX<0 OR NX>=W THEN 1140
1110 IF NY<0 OR NY>=H THEN 1140
1120 IF SCR$(OX+1+NX*2,OY+1+NY*2)=" " THEN 1140
1130 CD(N)=D:N=N+1
1140 NEXT
1150 IF N=0 THEN SP=SP-1:GOTO 1050
1160 D=CD(RND(N))
1170 NX=CX+VX(D):NY=CY+VY(D)
1180 REM KNOCK OUT THE WALL BETWEEN THE TWO CELLS, THEN THE CELL ITSELF
1190 LOCATE OX+1+CX*2+VX(D),OY+1+CY*2+VY(D):PRINT " ";
1200 LOCATE OX+1+NX*2,OY+1+NY*2:PRINT " ";
1210 SK(SP)=NY*W+NX:SP=SP+1
1220 GOTO 1050
